      "acceptance": "The base text of the Hermopolis fragment in §9 — from '[...] and in the last days they will make for themselves an image that speaks' through 'The day is' — is character-identical to §30's reproduction. The translator notes are present in §9 but formatted as working-copy apparatus rather than inline text interruptions. A reader comparing §9 and §30 can see that the compiler has reprinted the bare text, stripping Sefton's annotations.",
