      "instruction": "Add a brief Reyes log entry at the close of §15 (after Document 68 and before the end of the chapter), dated 2–3 September 2027, in which Reyes notes that two copies of LGL-2027-MGL-004 appear to exist (the distributed copy and the compliance file copy) and that he plans to pull both and compare them before the acknowledgment deadline. The entry should suggest he has noticed something worth checking without stating the discrepancy explicitly — he is setting up a task, not reporting a finding. Keep the entry to six lines or fewer; end it with a hash placeholder of exactly 64 hexadecimal characters in the established format. Do not alter any existing documents in §15 (Documents 63–68).",
